    "body": "### Problem description\n\nReference config [`nvim-0.12`](https://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax/tree/main/configs/nvim-0.12) (for Neovim>=0.12) is currently in beta-testing. The general structure and overall design are stable and should work fine.\n\nHowever, there might be some minor issues that are specific for `nvim-0.12` config in particular that might improved or clarified. Please feel free to report them here.",
