            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hi @echasnovski,\n\nstarting neovim with MiniMax results in `could not load vim.pack module` erorrs with multiple neovim versions installed on my machine.\nFor example I've `nvim 0.11.5` installed via homebrew and manually stored `nvim-nightly` in `~/.local/bin/nvim-nightly`. But I get the error mentioned above when running the command `NVIM_APPNAME=nvim-minimax nvim-nightly`\n\nAfter installing `bob` to manage multiple neovim versions, it was working fine.",
