            "body": "> `NVIM_APPNAME=nvim-minimax nvim-nightly`\n\nThe error shows that `nvim-nightly` is a Neovim version that doesn't yet have `vim.pack`. You can see the exact version it uses with `NVIM_APPNAME=nvim-minimax nvim-nightly --version` (dropping `NVIM_APPNAME` is fine, but this should make it clearer). I don't think this is a MiniMax problem, but the general Neovim installation issue.",
