        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hi @echasnovski, I just started setting up a remote tmux server and when connecting via SSH to my remote server and open neovim, I get the following warning message\n<img width=\"1499\" height=\"773\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d0230ae-f022-4f32-8e8d-4f40b86eda57\" />\n\nI disabled the method for now.\n```\n  if not (vim.env.SSH_TTY or vim.env.SSH_CONNECTION) then\n    MiniMisc.setup_termbg_sync()\n  end\n```\n ",
